# rc-9.com autonomous ops schedule (supercronic, baked into the cron image).
# TZ=America/New_York (set in Dockerfile.cron + docker-compose.yml).
#
# Each line invokes `docker compose run --rm worker <role>` via run-worker.sh, which
# spawns a fresh one-shot worker container and exits.
#
# supercronic-compatible 5-field cron (no @reboot).

# Engineer — every 6h. Bash-driven: render health-check (live site), npm-run-build
# gate, sweeps engineering tasks, posts a Slack 👍 heartbeat when healthy+idle.
18,48 * * * *  bash ops/scripts/run-worker.sh engineer
# Deployer — every 15 min if .deploy-needed flag exists.
# NOTE: rc-9 deploys via `npx wrangler deploy` (Vite SPA), not git push.
*/15 * * * *  [ ! -f .deploy-needed ] || bash ops/scripts/run-worker.sh deployer

# Watchdog — self-healing incident loop every 15 min (offset off scraper/deployer).
2,17,32,47 * * * *   bash ops/scripts/run-watchdog.sh

# Reaper — moved fleet-wide (tools/scripts/reap-stuck-workers-fleet.sh, host
# crontab, same 7,22,37,52 cadence). See that script's header for why: 16
# identical per-site copies collapsed into one host-level pass since
# docker.sock is the same shared daemon for every site anyway.

# Promoter — Tue/Fri 8am. Writes evergreen spotlight items about the site
# itself into ops/social/spotlight/*.md for tools/social-hub to draft from.
# No deploy, no site/ writes.
53 8 * * 2,5  bash ops/scripts/run-worker.sh promoter

# Principal Engineer — every 5 min (offset :01/:06/.../:56 to dodge the
# deployer's */5 :00 tick, the scraper's */15 :00 tick, and watchdog's
# :02/17/32/47). Cron-direct like watchdog: a zero-token scan of every Slack
# error/warning since the last tick (ops/logs/slack-*.jsonl, written by
# notify-slack.sh) only spins a worker when something distinct and real shows
# up. Reacts to ANY role/script's failure that reaches Slack — investigates,
# fixes, hardens, self-reviews, and (build-gated) commits+pushes; flags
# fleet-wide rollout candidates as a human-triage task rather than acting on
# them. Kill switch: touch ops/.principal-engineer-disabled.
1,6,11,16,21,26,31,36,41,46,51,56 * * * *   bash ops/scripts/run-principal-engineer.sh